# 07 — Sliding Window (10s window, 5s slide)
# Window [0s-10s]: 20, 22, 25, 30 → avg 24.25
# Window [5s-15s]: 25, 30, 18 → avg 24.33
# Window [10s-20s]: 18, 35 → avg 26.5

@0s SensorReading { temperature: 20.0 }
@3s SensorReading { temperature: 22.0 }
@5s SensorReading { temperature: 25.0 }
@8s SensorReading { temperature: 30.0 }
@12s SensorReading { temperature: 18.0 }
@16s SensorReading { temperature: 35.0 }
